# Disk images, archives and other binaries are stored byte for byte. Without this, git guesses
# from the content, and with core.autocrlf on it rewrites "line endings" in any part of the
# ReactOS CD that happens to look like text.
*.img binary
*.iso binary
*.bin binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
*.wasm binary
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.woff2 binary
